{"seq":3,"slug":"containment-eradication","title":"遏制与根除","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/containment-eradication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"containment-strategies","title":"遏制策略与隔离技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/containment-eradication/containment-strategies","wordCount":2773,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"malware-analysis","title":"恶意软件分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/containment-eradication/malware-analysis","wordCount":2501,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"recovery-restoration","title":"系统恢复与业务复原","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/containment-eradication/recovery-restoration","wordCount":2714,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"遏制与根除\">遏制与根除</h1><p>本章覆盖安全事件处置的核心执行阶段。遏制策略决定了如何在最短时间内阻止攻击扩散，包括网络隔离、账户冻结和系统快照等手段。恶意软件分析通过静态逆向与动态沙箱结合的方式，揭示攻击载荷的行为特征和 C2 通信机制。系统恢复则关注从备份还原、补丁修复到业务复原的全流程，确保组织在最短时间内恢复正常运营。</p>\n"}